{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2023-05-23 02:30:00', 'title': 'RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES INTRODUCES HIGHLY EFFICIENT AND COST-EFFECTIVE INTERNET SOLUTION FOR ALL BIZJET CABIN SIZES', 'text': "GENEVA, SWITZERLAND , MAY 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES' (NYSE: RTX) COLLINS AEROSPACE BUSINESS HAS LAUNCHED A NEW COST-EFFECTIVE, CABIN CONNECTIVITY SOLUTION, ALLOWING BUSINESS JET OPERATORS - OF ALL CABIN SIZES - TO KEEP THEIR PASSENGERS CONNECTED WHILE IN THE AIR. \xa0 THE COLLINS AEROSPACE IRT NX SATELLITE COMMUNICATION (SATCOM) SYSTEM FOR IRIDIUM CERTUS ® \xa0700 IS AMONG THE FIRST CERTIFIED CONNECTED CABIN HARDWARE AND SERVICE SOLUTIONS THAT CAN BE INSTALLED AND OPERATED GLOBALLY ON A VARIETY OF AIRCRAFT PLATFORMS."}